# QNAP x86_64 / amd64 deployment notes
#
# The ready-to-use compose-amd64.yaml intentionally uses fixed QNAP paths.
# If your Container shared folder is stored elsewhere, change this path in
# compose-amd64.yaml before creating the application:
#
#   /share/Container/cfhost/data
#
# WebUI:
#   http://<QNAP-IP>:9876
#
# Files stored in the data directory:
#   config.json
#   state.json
#   tracker-samples.tsv      (optional, required for real Tracker announce)
#   github-token             (optional, required when GitHub sync is enabled)
#   legacy-hosts-map.tsv     (optional migration input)
